 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Depends on the number of CG iterations and the cost of ray marching per iteration. Each iteration requires one forward render and one back-projection [S1].
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(N_v)$ for volume storage, where $N_v$ is the number of voxels. No explicit storage of $W$ ($O(N_p N_v)$) is required [S1].
