 ## Background
-This method was introduced in "Property and Lighting Manipulations for Static Volume Stylization Using a Painting Metaphor" (2014) [S1]. It builds on the linearity of light transport and the sparsity of the rendering operator. The use of Conjugate Gradient for volume reconstruction allows for efficient optimization of volume properties without the memory overhead of direct matrix inversion [S1].
